#: Sidralune/Views/SolarSystemView.cs
msgid "Solar and lunar eclipses from the active site. A solar eclipse is timed at its maximum there, a lunar eclipse at greatest eclipse, the same moment everywhere. Select one for its phases with the Sun's or Moon's altitude; Show in sky sets the time to it."
